# Examples. Kept out of the repo deliberately: the notebooks carry account
# identifiers, live subscription ids and warehouse names in their saved cells,
# and a notebook's outputs are the easiest place to leak one by accident. Write
# them locally; the prose that matters lives in README.md, where it is
# reviewable as a diff.
